<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait private deposits down 0.9 pct in June.</title>
<headline>Kuwait private deposits down 0.9 pct in June.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Private sector deposits with local banks in Kuwait fell 0.9 percent to 7.019 billion dinars at the end of June from 7.082 billion at the end of May, Central Bank figures showed.</p>
<p>The deposits stood at 7.089 billion in June 1995.</p>
<p>			  Data in million dinars</p>
<p>				  June '96	    June '95</p>
<p>Dinar deposits		5,676.6	     5,797.6</p>
<p>Foreign currency deposits 1,342.0	     1,291.5</p>
<p>($1 = 0.2999)</p>
<p>-- Inal Ersan, Kuwait newsroom +965-243-1920</p>
</text>
